# Cloudflare Pages headers. Always revalidate our own files so a fresh deploy loads immediately
# (no stale editor cached in the browser). Files are small and return 304 when unchanged, so this is
# cheap. Only Pyodide (editor) still comes from a CDN (jsDelivr) and is unaffected.
# KaTeX and MathJax are served from this site since W3b (11.11.2026), in folders with the version in the
# path: /wissen/assets/katex-0.16.11/ and /wissen/assets/mathjax-3.2.2/. Their files never change, so the
# browser keeps them for a year without asking again (immutable). A new version gets a new folder and new
# links (build_wissen.py: KATEX/MATHJAX and FORMEL_EXPORT_JS; web/editor.html), then add its rule here.
# "! Cache-Control" removes the no-cache of the /* rule first (otherwise Cloudflare joins both values).
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/wissen/assets/katex-0.16.11/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/wissen/assets/mathjax-3.2.2/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
